Subject: [PATCH 07/18] feat: Firuzeh theme
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VERSION: 2.0 (2026-10-12)  2.0 = merged set of 11 patches (old numbers below)
Root: build/outline-1.11.0 (apply after 0001..0006)

(was 0012 v1.0)
- Light: warm paper canvas (#FFFDF8), pale mint sidebar, turquoise accent
  (#0F8C8C) instead of blue; dark: ink-navy (#141A2A) with turquoise links.
- Vazirmatn first in the UI font stack (Inter for Latin), JetBrains Mono for
  code, bold 700.
- Accent-coloured quote bars, softer layered shadows for menus and dialogs,
  280px sidebar, calmer notice colours.
- Theme tokens only (shared/styles/theme.ts).

Files (1; N = new, M = modified, D = deleted):
  M shared/styles/theme.ts

---
---

